# Lovers in the Dusk (bastok 63): Carmelo in Port Bastok, qm4 in The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah. The guard (A Test of True Love
# completed, Bastok fame level 6, the quest's own mustZone clear: A Test of True Love's completion sets it), the offer
# 275 (the Chanson de Liberte, accepted), Carmelo's 276, qm4's 204 at dusk (17:00-17:59) and the reward, then 277
# (replaceDefault). Carmelo's default is 182; The Siren's Tear's Prog var is 2 (its last cutscene seen), so it stays
# silent. qm4's default is the text NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY; the other quests and missions that name a qm4 are in other
# zones. The harness clock starts at noon: 5 game hours on it is dusk.
lists PortBastok/Carmelo/onTrigger PortBastok/Carmelo/onTrade TheSanctuaryOfZitah/qm4/onTrigger PortBastok/onEventFinish/275 TheSanctuaryOfZitah/onEventFinish/204
char zone=PortBastok pos=-146.5,-7.48,13 lvl=75
fame Bastok 424
charvar Quest[1][0]Prog 2
item BoneChip
login
trade Carmelo BoneChip x1      # available: no trade handler, nothing
trigger Carmelo                # A Test of True Love not completed (nor Love and Ice): his default 182
finish
quest Bastok.ATestOfTrueLove completed
trigger Carmelo                # fame 424 (level 5): 182
finish
fame Bastok 425
charvar Quest[1][63]mustZone 236
trigger Carmelo                # the quest's mustZone set: 182
finish
zoneline BastokMarkets         # out and back: the mustZone cleared
zoneline PortBastok
trigger Carmelo                # the offer, 275
finish                         # the Chanson de Liberte, accepted
trigger Carmelo                # accepted: 276
finish
warp 21.6,0.483,94.6 TheSanctuaryOfZitah
trigger qm4                    # day, not dusk: nil, its default text
finish-if-event
wait vana=5                    # 17:00, dusk
tick 1000
trigger qm4                    # dusk: 204
finish                         # completed: Siren Flute, fame +70, the Chanson deleted
trigger qm4                    # completed: no handler, its default text
finish-if-event
warp -146.5,-7.48,13 PortBastok
trigger Carmelo                # completed: 277
finish
trade Carmelo BoneChip x1      # completed: no trade handler, nothing
